    "detailed_description": "This story unfolds in a chilling, Lovecraftian setting where professor Daniel Castane navigates a series of harrowing events on a mysterious island dominated by a sinister cult. On his journey he encounters various people warning him of the island's dark secrets and the cult's intentions. Daniel faces brutal murder and the pervasive influence of the cult which members believe in a prophecy.<br />\r\nAs Daniel attempts to escape the island, he undergoes numerous trials, he performs a disturbing ritual and confronts with cultists. His journey is marked by eerie visions, hallucinations, and encounters with monstrous beings.<br />\r\nThe narrative of this story explores themes of madness, transformation, and the struggle for survival against cosmic horrors. Will Daniel endure a cycle of nightmares and psychological torment, blurring the line between reality and delusion? Will he survive in a world where ancient gods and their followers seek to upend human reality and retain his sanity and find a way back to a normal life? Find it out yourself.",
